# Deterministic bytes on every platform.
#
# The OC4 geometry tables are verified by SHA-256 against
# data/geometry/MANIFEST.json before the app will use them. Git's automatic
# CRLF translation changes those bytes on checkout, so on a Windows clone the
# integrity check fails and the app refuses to start - correctly, since it
# cannot tell an editing accident from a line-ending conversion.
#
# Found by cloning the repository fresh on Windows. It never showed up in the
# working tree the files were authored in, which is the point of testing a
# clone rather than a checkout you already have.

* text=auto eol=lf

# Hash-verified data: never translate these, whatever the platform or the
# user's core.autocrlf setting.
data/geometry/*.csv          -text
data/geometry/MANIFEST.json  -text
data/constituents/*.json     -text

# Keep binary artefacts binary.
*.png  binary
*.pdf  binary
*.parquet binary
*.nc   binary
